1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:03,375
W: Do you know if enough people have registered for the computer class?

2
00:00:03,625 --> 00:00:07,140
I have to let Mr. Terrance know whether the class is going to open or not.

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:10,820
M: I checked the list earlier, and there were many who had already registered.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,125
I think it's safe to tell Mr. Terrance that the class is going to be held.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,160
In fact, ask him if he would be interested in opening an extra class?

6
00:00:19,825 --> 00:00:25,300
Registration lasts until this Friday, and I think there is a good chance that we could fill another class.

7
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,620
W: I think he would be happy to hear that.

8
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,260
I will call him right away to see what he says.

9
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:36,300
M: Thanks, and could you also do me a favor and see how many people have registered for the cooking class?
